{
    "name": "x402",
    "title": "x402 \u00b7 every paid API",
    "version": "0.3.0",
    "description": "Every x402 (HTTP 402 pay-per-request) service that exists, in one local index. Facilitators are discovered from the coinbase/x402 ecosystem registry and crawled through the spec's discovery API (Coinbase CDP Bazaar, PayAI and any other that lists); find() searches them by meaning (local MiniLM vectors fused with FTS, encoder shared via modsearch) and kind=mcp ranks paid MCP servers; any URL can be probed for its 402 and pinned. Keyless, stdlib-only, one SQLite file; re-crawls itself every 6h.",
    "icon": "402",
    "color": "#facc15",
    "anchor": "mod.py",
    "network": "local",
